# here — `/*  /index.html  200` — as an infinite loop, because it would strip
# `.html` / `/index` and re-trigger itself. It failed the deploy, not the build.
#
# Only restore a rule here if this moves to Cloudflare Pages, which uses this
# file instead of the wrangler setting.
